#: ../../api/types/update.rst:3
msgid "Update"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update:1 of
msgid ""
"This `object <https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#available-types>`_ "
"represents an incoming update."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update:3 of
msgid "At most **one** of the optional fields can be present in any given update."
msgstr ""
"В обновлении может присутствовать не более **одного** из необязательных "
"полей."

#: litegram.types.update.Update:5 of
msgid "Source: https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#update"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.update_id:1 of
msgid ""
"The update's unique identifier. Update identifiers start from a certain "
"positive number and increase sequentially. This identifier becomes "
"especially handy if you're using `webhooks "
"<https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#setwebhook>`_, since it allows you to"
" ignore repeated updates or to restore the correct update sequence, "
"should they get out of order. If there are no new updates for at least a "
"week, then identifier of the next update will be chosen randomly instead "
"of sequentially."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.message:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. New incoming message of any kind - text, photo, sticker, etc."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.edited_message:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New version of a message that is known to the bot and was "
"edited. This update may at times be triggered by changes to message "
"fields that are either unavailable or not actively used by your bot."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.channel_post:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New incoming channel post of any kind - text, photo, sticker,"
" etc."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.edited_channel_post:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New version of a channel post that is known to the bot and "
"was edited. This update may at times be triggered by changes to message "
"fields that are either unavailable or not actively used by your bot."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.business_connection:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. The bot was connected to or disconnected from a business "
"account, or a user edited an existing connection with the bot"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.business_message:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. New message from a connected business account"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.edited_business_message:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. New version of a message from a connected business account"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.deleted_business_messages:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. Messages were deleted from a connected business account"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.message_reaction:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A reaction to a message was changed by a user. The bot must "
"be an administrator in the chat and must explicitly specify "
":code:`\"message_reaction\"` in the list of *allowed_updates* to receive "
"these updates. The update isn't received for reactions set by bots."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.message_reaction_count:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. Reactions to a message with anonymous reactions were changed."
" The bot must be an administrator in the chat and must explicitly specify"
" :code:`\"message_reaction_count\"` in the list of *allowed_updates* to "
"receive these updates. The updates are grouped and can be sent with delay"
" up to a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.inline_query:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New incoming `inline <https://core.telegram.org/bots/api"
"#inline-mode>`_ query"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.chosen_inline_result:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. The result of an `inline <https://core.telegram.org/bots/api"
"#inline-mode>`_ query that was chosen by a user and sent to their chat "
"partner. Please see our documentation on the `feedback collecting "
"<https://core.telegram.org/bots/inline#collecting-feedback>`_ for details"
" on how to enable these updates for your bot."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.callback_query:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. New incoming callback query"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.shipping_query:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New incoming shipping query. Only for invoices with flexible "
"price."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Новый входящий запрос на доставку. Только для счетов с "
"гибкой ценой."

#: litegram.types.update.Update.pre_checkout_query:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New incoming pre-checkout query. Contains full information "
"about checkout."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Новый входящий pre-checkout-запрос. Содержит полную "
"информацию об оформлении заказа."

#: litegram.types.update.Update.poll:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New poll state. Bots receive only updates about manually "
"stopped polls and polls, which are sent by the bot."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Новое состояние опроса. Боты получают обновления только "
"о вручную остановленных опросах и об опросах, отправленных самим ботом."

#: litegram.types.update.Update.poll_answer:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A user changed their answer in a non-anonymous poll. Bots "
"receive new votes only in polls that were sent by the bot itself."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.my_chat_member:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. The bot's chat member status was updated in a chat. For "
"private chats, this update is received only when the bot is blocked or "
"unblocked by the user."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.chat_member:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A chat member's status was updated in a chat. The bot must be"
" an administrator in the chat and must explicitly specify "
":code:`\"chat_member\"` in the list of *allowed_updates* to receive these"
" updates."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.chat_join_request:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A request to join the chat has been sent. The bot must have "
"the *can_invite_users* administrator right in the chat to receive these "
"updates."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.chat_boost:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A chat boost was added or changed. The bot must be an "
"administrator in the chat to receive these updates."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.removed_chat_boost:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A boost was removed from a chat. The bot must be an "
"administrator in the chat to receive these updates."
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.guest_message:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New guest message. The bot can use the field "
"*Message.guest_query_id* and the method "
":class:`litegram.methods.answer_guest_query.AnswerGuestQuery` to send a "
"message in response."
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Новое гостевое сообщение. Бот может использовать поле "
"*Message.guest_query_id* и метод "
":class:`litegram.methods.answer_guest_query.AnswerGuestQuery`, чтобы "
"отправить ответное сообщение."

#: litegram.types.update.Update.widget_query:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New incoming query from a widget in a message sent by the bot"
" or via the bot"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Новый входящий запрос из виджета в сообщении, "
"отправленном ботом или через него"

#: litegram.types.update.Update.shared_widget_query:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. New incoming query from a forwarded message with a shared "
"widget"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Новый входящий запрос из пересланного сообщения с "
"переиспользуемым виджетом"

#: litegram.types.update.Update.purchased_paid_media:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A user purchased paid media with a non-empty payload sent by "
"the bot in a non-channel chat"
msgstr ""

#: litegram.types.update.Update.managed_bot:1 of
msgid ""
"*Optional*. A new bot was created to be managed by the bot, or token or "
"owner of a managed bot was changed"
msgstr ""
"*Необязательно*. Создан новый бот под управлением этого бота либо "
"изменены токен или владелец управляемого бота"

#: litegram.types.update.Update.subscription:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. User payment subscription has changed"
msgstr "*Необязательно*. Изменилась платная подписка пользователя"

#: litegram.types.update.Update.stopped_message_generation:1 of
msgid "*Optional*. A user asked the bot to stop the generation of a message"
msgstr "*Необязательно*. Пользователь попросил бота остановить генерацию сообщения"

#: litegram.types.update.Update.event_type:1 of
msgid "Detect update type If update type is unknown, raise UpdateTypeLookupError"
msgstr ""

